{
  "name": "rank_stratified_cap_no_int_v2",
  "intuition": "For each instance, deterministically rank candidates by objective (lower is better) and create pairwise preferences that always include best-vs-worst plus best-vs-near-top and best-vs-mid, then optionally mid-vs-tail; remaining budget is filled by best beating exponentially farther ranks to cover a range of difficulty levels.",
